  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Quinn mini crossbody adapts seamlessly to travel days, evenings out or any moment you want to keep your essentials close without extra bulk. An exterior slip pocket and interior slip pocket help organize tickets, cards or your phone, and the 22-inch adjustable strap lets you style for hands-free ease. Crafted from wipe-clean refined grain leather, it brings a polished finish to every look.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Refined Grain Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Two way script logo lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap Closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.8&quot; (L) x 4.6&quot; (H) x 2.10&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
